            "failureScenario": "A caller logs a valid signed JWT with an empty-object payload, such as `eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.e30.<signature>`, under an ordinary field such as `state`. Its three-character payload part fails the regex, so the token reaches the log provider or trace exporter unchanged (OWASP A09:2025)."
